content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Asking for and Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Here are some expressions you can use to ask for and to give advice.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you suggest? <br><br> How do you suggest I ... ? <br><br> Do you have any advice for ... ?<br><br>  What should I do?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The best way ...   <br><br>  I strongly advise ...<br><br>   Why don't you ... ? <br><br> It would be a good idea to ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Do you have any advice for studying online? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I strongly advise all students to use the student forum for online discussions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should ask questions for clarification.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Comparatives and Superlatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class=\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives.<br><br>  You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class=\"strong\">group </span> that he, she or it belongs to.<br><br>  You add <span class=\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form.<br><br>Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and superlative:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Adjective \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" fast  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" faster (than)  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the fastest \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Most adjectives: <br>+-er, +-est\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" late   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"later (than)  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Adjectives ending in -e:<br> +-r, +-st\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" happy    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"happier (than)    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the happiest    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2-syllable adjectives ending in -y:<br> +-ier, +-iest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" efficient    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more efficient (than)    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most efficient   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3+-syllable adjectives:<br><br>  more + adjective+ than  <br><br>most + adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br/>bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)<br/>worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br/>the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular comparisons\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "syllabus ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a document that lists topics you will study in a course", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The best way to contact me is by using the e-mail provided in the syllabus.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you take a course.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "classmate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is taking the same course as you ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is faster to ask questions online and get immediate answers from your classmates.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "introduction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "beginning of a topic ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  It might be a good idea to review the resources under the heading Introduction to Accounting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "forum", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area of a website for discussion on a topic ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I advise all students to use the student forum for online discussions. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "instructor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the teacher of a course (usually college-level) ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The best way to contact the instructor is by e-mail. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of an original name of a course you would like to take.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a 1 sentence introduction to the course. You can start with <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIn this course, you will learn ...\u201d </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "List the things you will learn in the course. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online for more ideas. You can search for real courses using key words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your course syllabus to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I choose a name for my course.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write an introduction sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe the syllabus.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present my syllabus to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Instructor</span>: Good morning, class. Are there any questions about the course before we begin?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Student 1</span>: How do you suggest we contact you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Instructor</span>:  The best way to contact me is by e-mail. The address is included in the syllabus."}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "13000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Student 1</span>: Do you have any advice for studying online?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Instructor</span>: I strongly advise all students to use the student forum for online discussions. It is faster and more efficient to ask questions online and get immediate answers from your classmates. It also might be a good idea to review the online resources. They are listed under the heading Introduction to Accounting.  It will make your experience more enjoyable."}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob03re2img06.jpg", "time": "37000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Excuse me? I'd like to know when we take a coffee break. I think that would make my experience more enjoyable."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about subjects and ways to study.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can ask for and respond to advice. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can compare two things. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you like to take courses online? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Which courses do you take online?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How difficult are online courses?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "This online course is called ... Introduction to Basket Weaving!", "type": "free_type_tex